@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_UserSideLayout.cshtml";
}
<div class="container p-5" style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; margin-top:30px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Mobile Support – Simplify Your Smartphone Experience</h1>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                In the present day, smartphones are part of nearly every individual's daily activity. They hold our phone numbers, diaries, and images and link us actively to the virtual space. There is a sense of chaos that disrupts your entire schedule whenever things go wrong technically. Be it the case that your applications refuse to launch, your battery drains faster than expected, or you are unable to understand why your phone is failing to connect to a wireless network, such situations can be very frustrating.
            </p>
            <br />
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Common Mobile Issues We Solve:</h2>
            <ul style="font-size: 18px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you facing recurrent app failure or software malfunction? They may happen as a result of obsolete versions or conflicts between applications.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Is your smartphone not lasting as long as before? The battery-saving features and options may need adjusting, or an app may need to be installed to control excessive battery consumption.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you finding it hard to connect to Wi-Fi or Bluetooth? This could be a foreseen settings calibration or some fault in the hardware.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Overwhelmed by the never-ending request for updates? System instability can occur when updates are installed incorrectly.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you curious about how to transfer your data to a new device? Most individuals find it difficult to move their pictures, contacts, applications, and so on.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">How TechValet Helps You:</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                Whether it's diagnosing software issues or configuring your new mobile device, we make sure that your phone works from all angles. With our step-by-step process, we guarantee that you will never get lost.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Call to Action Section -->
<div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding:20px">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Let us help you keep your mobile device in good working condition. Reach Out To Us Now.</h3>
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #555;">Call TechValet Computer Support for fast and reliable service.</p>
    <a href="@Url.Action("Contact","Home")" style="background-color: #E48F01; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 20px; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#E48F01'">
        Call Us Now
    </a>
</div>
